, with no trackers","content":"European privacy law, with no trackers","fill":"$ink-muted","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-15_2","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":40.54},{"type":"text","id":"t82","name":"and no data resale.","content":"and no data resale.","fill":"$ink-muted","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-15_2","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":65.62}]}]},{"type":"ref","id":"r9l","ref":"f9g","name":"footer / narrow","x":20,"y":2125.13}]}]}],"x":5780,"y":0},{"type":"ref","id":"D1yt","ref":"P9j","name":"GH-29/A/home/narrow/dark","x":6180,"y":0,"theme":{"mode":"dark"}},{"type":"frame","id":"Pby","name":"GH-29/A/about/desktop/light","reusable":true,"theme":{"mode":"light"},"width":1440,"height":2061,"clip":true,"layout":"none","fill":"$bg","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fbx","name":"body","x":0,"y":0,"width":1440,"height":2061.47,"fill":["$bg",{"type":"gradient","gradientType":"radial","colors":[{"color":"$literal-0EB8B812","position":0},{"color":"$literal-00000000","position":0.62}]}],"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fbw","name":"div.page-shell","x":0,"y":0,"width":1440,"height":2061.47,"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"ref","id":"rbz","ref":"f9v","name":"header / desktop","x":304,"y":0},{"type":"frame","id":"faj","name":"main","x":304,"y":100.97,"width":832,"height":1726.02,"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"f9w","name":"img \"Portrait of Rubens Pessoa\"","x":80,"y":56,"width":128,"height":128,"layout":"none","stroke":"$line-soft","strokeWidth":1,"strokeAlignment":"inner","cornerRadius":"$rounded-50","children":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"i9x","name":"image","metadata":{"type":"image-asset","reason":"raster image the site ships (photo, illustration or logo file)"},"x":1,"y":1,"width":126,"height":126,"fill":{"type":"image","url":"images/18a2ca1627159703.jpg","mode":"cover"}}]},{"type":"text","id":"t9y","name":"ABOUT","content":"ABOUT","fill":"$ink-muted","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-12_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-590","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing-1_28","x":92.78,"y":215.94},{"type":"text","id":"t9z","name":"Hi, I’m Rubens.","content":"Hi, I’m Rubens.","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-40","fontSize":"$fontSize-40","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_88","x":80,"y":248.61},{"type":"text","id":"ta0","name":"I’m a Brazilian founder living in Graz, ","content":"I’m a Brazilian founder living in Graz, Austria. I make apps for iOS, iPadOS, macOS, and watchOS, and I do everything myself: the design, the code, and the support inbox. Pixeldog is the name I put on all of it.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":329.08},{"type":"text","id":"ta1","name":"Everything I ship is native, and I sweat","content":"Everything I ship is native, and I sweat the details: how an app feels on the platform it lives on, how it behaves offline, and what happens to your data. The short version is that it stays yours. Working alone also means there’s nobody else to blame when a detail is off, which turns out to be excellent motivation for getting the details right.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":430.82},{"type":"text","id":"ta2","name":"Outside of work I’m usually on a bike, o","content":"Outside of work I’m usually on a bike, on skis I’m still learning to trust, or playing the guitar I never quite put down after years in a band. I’m married to a brilliant engineer, so home is basically a happy nerdy two-person lab.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":560.6},{"type":"frame","id":"fad","name":"section.graz","x":80,"y":700.77,"width":672,"height":793.92,"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"text","id":"ta3","name":"Made in Graz.","content":"Made in Graz.","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":0,"y":-0.48},{"type":"text","id":"ta4","name":"Graz has been home for seven years now. ","content":"Graz has been home for seven years now. I ride my bicycle basically everywhere, because here you can. Sundays are properly quiet: shops closed, streets slow, and I’ve grown to love that pace. For a city this size there is a stubborn amount of culture, from opera to street festivals, and it rubs off on you. I think you can see it in the apps. Quiet, unhurried software, made a short walk from the places in these photos.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":0,"y":36.93},{"type":"text","id":"ta5","name":"And I’m not from here. I came from Brazi","content":"And I’m not from here. I came from Brazil, chose this place, and I care about it the way you care about things you chose. Pixeldog is a small way of giving something back to the city and the continent that became home.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":0,"y":194.76},{"type":"frame","id":"fac","name":"div.graz__grid","x":0,"y":302.92,"width":672,"height":491,"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fa6","name":"img \"The Uhrturm clock tower on the Schlossbe\"","x":0,"y":0,"width":328,"height":491,"layout":"none","stroke":"$line-soft","strokeWidth":1,"strokeAlignment":"inner","cornerRadius":"$rounded-lg","children":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"ia7","name":"image","metadata":{"type":"image-asset","reason":"raster image the site ships (photo, illustration or logo file)"},"x":1,"y":1,"width":326,"height":489,"fill":{"type":"image","url":"images/3cd5e0db3a9d2177.webp","mode":"cover"}}]},{"type":"frame","id":"fa8","name":"img \"The Murinsel floating platform on the Mu\"","x":344,"y":0,"width":328,"height":237.5,"layout":"none","stroke":"$line-soft","strokeWidth":1,"strokeAlignment":"inner","cornerRadius":"$rounded-lg","children":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"ia9","name":"image","metadata":{"type":"image-asset","reason":"raster image the site ships (photo, illustration or logo file)"},"x":1,"y":1,"width":326,"height":235.5,"fill":{"type":"image","url":"images/1d0d98108fedbe58.webp","mode":"cover"}}]},{"type":"frame","id":"faa","name":"img \"The Hauptplatz in Graz on a wet evening,\"","x":344,"y":253.5,"width":328,"height":237.5,"layout":"none","stroke":"$line-soft","strokeWidth":1,"strokeAlignment":"inner","cornerRadius":"$rounded-lg","children":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"iab","name":"image","metadata":{"type":"image-asset","reason":"raster image the site ships (photo, illustration or logo file)"},"x":1,"y":1,"width":326,"height":235.5,"fill":{"type":"image","url":"images/6febbf5e8526f57a.webp","mode":"cover"}}]}]}]},{"type":"text","id":"tae","name":"If one of these apps ends up on your pho","content":"If one of these apps ends up on your phone, now you know who made it and where.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":1534.66},{"type":"text","id":"taf","name":"Questions about the apps, or just want t","content":"Questions about the apps, or just want to say hi? Write me","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":1580.3},{"type":"text","id":"tag","name":"at","content":"at","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":1608.35},{"type":"text","id":"tah","name":"contact@rubenspessoa.dev","content":"contact@rubenspessoa.dev","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","underline":true,"x":99.05,"y":1608.35},{"type":"text","id":"tai","name":".","content":".","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":310.38,"y":1608.35}]},{"type":"ref","id":"rc0","ref":"f32","name":"footer / desktop","x":304,"y":1826.98}]}]}],"x":6780,"y":0},{"type":"ref","id":"D1yu","ref":"Pby","name":"GH-29/A/about/desktop/dark","x":8300,"y":0,"theme":{"mode":"dark"}},{"type":"frame","id":"Ped","name":"GH-29/A/about/mobile/light","reusable":true,"theme":{"mode":"light"},"width":390,"height":3114,"clip":true,"layout":"none","fill":"$bg","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fec","name":"body","x":0,"y":0,"width":390,"height":3113.55,"fill":["$bg",{"type":"gradient","gradientType":"radial","colors":[{"color":"$literal-0EB8B812","position":0},{"color":"$literal-00000000","position":0.62}]}],"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"feb","name":"div.page-shell","x":0,"y":0,"width":390,"height":3113.55,"layout":"vertical","padding":[0,0,0,"$spacing-20"],"children":[{"type":"ref","id":"ree","ref":"fca","name":"header / mobile","x":20,"y":0},{"type":"frame","id":"fcy","name":"main","x":20,"y":95.67,"width":350,"height":2698.56,"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fcb","name":"img \"Portrait of Rubens Pessoa\"","x":0,"y":56,"width":128,"height":128,"layout":"none","stroke":"$line-soft","strokeWidth":1,"strokeAlignment":"inner","cornerRadius":"$rounded-50","children":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"icc","name":"image","metadata":{"type":"image-asset","reason":"raster image the site ships (photo, illustration or logo file)"},"x":1,"y":1,"width":126,"height":126,"fill":{"type":"image","url":"images/18a2ca1627159703.jpg","mode":"cover"}}]},{"type":"text","id":"tcd","name":"ABOUT","content":"ABOUT","fill":"$ink-muted","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-12_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-590","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing-1_28","x":12.78,"y":215.94},{"type":"text","id":"tce","name":"Hi, I’m Rubens.","content":"Hi, I’m Rubens.","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-30","fontSize":"$fontSize-30_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_67","x":0,"y":248.37},{"type":"text","id":"tcf","name":"I’m a Brazilian founder living in Graz, ","content":"I’m a Brazilian founder living in Graz, Austria. I make apps for iOS, iPadOS, macOS, and watchOS, and I do everything myself: the design, the code, and the support inbox. Pixeldog is the name I put on all of it.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":317.57},{"type":"text","id":"tcg","name":"Everything I ship is native, and I sweat","content":"Everything I ship is native, and I sweat the details: how an app feels on the platform it lives on, how it behaves offline, and what happens to your data. The short version is that it stays yours. Working alone also means there’s nobody else to blame when a detail is off, which turns out to be excellent motivation for getting the details right.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":475.4},{"type":"text","id":"tch","name":"Outside of work I’m usually on a bike, o","content":"Outside of work I’m usually on a bike, on skis I’m still learning to trust, or playing the guitar I never quite put down after years in a band. I’m married to a brilliant engineer, so home is basically a happy nerdy two-person lab.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":717.37},{"type":"frame","id":"fcs","name":"section.graz","x":0,"y":913.63,"width":350,"height":1525.56,"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"text","id":"tci","name":"Made in Graz.","content":"Made in Graz.","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":0,"y":-0.48},{"type":"text","id":"tcj","name":"Graz has been home for seven years now. ","content":"Graz has been home for seven years now. I ride my bicycle basically everywhere, because here you can. Sundays are properly quiet: shops closed, streets slow, and I’ve grown to love that pace. For a city this size there is a stubborn amount of culture, from opera to street festivals, and it rubs off on you. I think you can see it in the apps. Quiet, unhurried software, made a short walk from the places in these photos.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":36.93},{"type":"text","id":"tck","name":"And I’m not from here. I came from Brazi","content":"And I’m not from here. I came from Brazil, chose this place, and I care about it the way you care about things you chose. Pixeldog is a small way of giving something back to the city and the continent that became home.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":334.99},{"type":"frame","id":"fcr","name":"div.graz__grid","x":0,"y":499.25,"width":350,"height":1026.31,"layout":"vertical","gap":"$spacing-16","padding":[0,0,0,0],"children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fcl","name":"img \"The Uhrturm clock tower on the Schlossbe\"","x":0,"y":0,"width":350,"height":524,"layout":"none","stroke":"$line-soft","strokeWidth":1,"strokeAlignment":"inner","cornerRadius":"$rounded-lg","children":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"icm","name":"image","metadata":{"type":"image-asset","reason":"raster image the site ships (photo, illustration or logo file)"},"x":1,"y":1,"width":348,"height":522,"fill":{"type":"image","url":"images/3cd5e0db3a9d2177.webp","mode":"cover"}}]},{"type":"frame","id":"fcn","name":"img \"The Murinsel floating platform on the Mu\"","x":0,"y":540,"width":350,"height":235.16,"layout":"none","stroke":"$line-soft","strokeWidth":1,"strokeAlignment":"inner","cornerRadius":"$rounded-lg","children":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"ico","name":"image","metadata":{"type":"image-asset","reason":"raster image the site ships (photo, illustration or logo file)"},"x":1,"y":1,"width":348,"height":233.16,"fill":{"type":"image","url":"images/1d0d98108fedbe58.webp","mode":"cover"}}]},{"type":"frame","id":"fcp","name":"img \"The Hauptplatz in Graz on a wet evening,\"","x":0,"y":791.16,"width":350,"height":235.16,"layout":"none","stroke":"$line-soft","strokeWidth":1,"strokeAlignment":"inner","cornerRadius":"$rounded-lg","children":[{"type":"rectangle","id":"icq","name":"image","metadata":{"type":"image-asset","reason":"raster image the site ships (photo, illustration or logo file)"},"x":1,"y":1,"width":348,"height":233.16,"fill":{"type":"image","url":"images/6febbf5e8526f57a.webp","mode":"cover"}}]}]}]},{"type":"text","id":"tct","name":"If one of these apps ends up on your pho","content":"If one of these apps ends up on your phone, now you know who made it and where.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":2479.16},{"type":"text","id":"tcu","name":"Questions about the apps, or just want t","content":"Questions about the apps, or just want to say","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":2552.85},{"type":"text","id":"tcv","name":"hi? Write me at","content":"hi? Write me at","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":2580.9},{"type":"text","id":"tcw","name":"contact@rubenspessoa.dev","content":"contact@rubenspessoa.dev","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","underline":true,"x":117.59,"y":2580.9},{"type":"text","id":"tcx","name":".","content":".","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":328.92,"y":2580.9}]},{"type":"ref","id":"ref","ref":"f6a","name":"footer / mobile","x":20,"y":2794.23}]}]}],"x":9820,"y":0},{"type":"ref","id":"D1yv","ref":"Ped","name":"GH-29/A/about/mobile/dark","x":10290,"y":0,"theme":{"mode":"dark"}},{"type":"frame","id":"Pgp","name":"GH-29/A/about/narrow/light","reusable":true,"theme":{"mode":"light"},"width":320,"height":3296,"clip":true,"layout":"none","fill":"$bg","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fgo","name":"body","x":0,"y":0,"width":320,"height":3296.38,"fill":["$bg",{"type":"gradient","gradientType":"radial","colors":[{"color":"$literal-0EB8B812","position":0},{"color":"$literal-00000000","position":0.62}]}],"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fgn","name":"div.page-shell","x":0,"y":0,"width":320,"height":3296.38,"layout":"vertical","padding":[0,0,0,"$spacing-20"],"children":[{"type"