"AI features","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":80,"y":807.86},{"type":"text","id":"ton","name":"In apps with AI features, the content yo","content":"In apps with AI features, the content you submit for processing — photos, text, uploaded documents, or text transcribed from voice input — is sent through our servers to third-party AI providers, solely to generate the result. This content carries no account identifier, is not used to train AI models under our API agreements, and is not stored on our servers: it is processed in memory and discarded.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":836.07},{"type":"text","id":"too","name":"Your content","content":"Your content","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":80,"y":1004.25},{"type":"text","id":"top","name":"The content you create in our apps — sav","content":"The content you create in our apps — saved photos, chat history, habits, notes, and similar — is stored on your device and, if you use iCloud, synced through your own private iCloud storage. We run no accounts and keep no copy on our servers.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":1032.46},{"type":"text","id":"toq","name":"Anonymous identifiers","content":"Anonymous identifiers","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":80,"y":1144.55},{"type":"text","id":"tor","name":"Apps that talk to our servers create an ","content":"Apps that talk to our servers create an anonymous identifier via Firebase to enforce fair usage limits and connect a subscription to your installation, and may verify requests with Firebase App Check to keep bots away. We cannot identify you personally from these identifiers.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":1172.76},{"type":"text","id":"tos","name":"Location","content":"Location","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":80,"y":1312.89},{"type":"text","id":"tot","name":"In apps with location-based features, an","content":"In apps with location-based features, and only with your permission, your device location is used at query time to show nearby results. It is not stored as a movement history.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":1341.1},{"type":"text","id":"tou","name":"Ads and attribution","content":"Ads and attribution","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":80,"y":1453.19},{"type":"text","id":"tov","name":"In apps with a free ad-supported tier, a","content":"In apps with a free ad-supported tier, ads are served by Google AdMob: if you allow tracking in the iOS App Tracking Transparency prompt, ads may be personalized; if you decline, they are not. Attribution services (such as AppsFlyer or Adjust) process device identifiers to attribute app installs to marketing campaigns, subject to the same tracking choice.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":1481.4},{"type":"text","id":"tow","name":"Analytics and crash reporting","content":"Analytics and crash reporting","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":80,"y":1649.58},{"type":"text","id":"tox","name":"Our apps may collect analytics events ab","content":"Our apps may collect analytics events about feature usage — not the content you create — and crash reports (device model, OS version, crash traces) to keep the apps working well.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":1677.79},{"type":"text","id":"toy","name":"This website and app websites","content":"This website and app websites","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":80,"y":1789.87},{"type":"text","id":"toz","name":"This website (rubenspessoa.dev) is stati","content":"This website (rubenspessoa.dev) is static and sets no cookies and runs no analytics. Some app websites use analytics and, where required, ask for cookie consent; their processing is covered by the services listed below.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":1818.08},{"type":"text","id":"tp0","name":"Third-party services","content":"Third-party services","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":80,"y":1937.77},{"type":"text","id":"tp1","name":"We keep the list of processors as small ","content":"We keep the list of processors as small as each app allows. Not every service is used by every app — which subset applies depends on the app’s features. Contact us for app-specific details:","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":1975.18},{"type":"text","id":"tp2","name":"Apple (USA): App Store distribution, pay","content":"Apple (USA): App Store distribution, payments, device services, iCloud","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2076.91},{"type":"text","id":"tp3","name":"Google Firebase (USA/Ireland): server in","content":"Google Firebase (USA/Ireland): server infrastructure (Cloud Functions), app verification (App Check), analytics (Google Analytics for Firebase), and crash reporting (Crashlytics)","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":652.5,"x":100,"y":2110.55},{"type":"text","id":"tp4","name":"RevenueCat (USA): subscription status, k","content":"RevenueCat (USA): subscription status, keyed to anonymous identifiers","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2200.29},{"type":"text","id":"tp5","name":"OpenAI (USA) and Anthropic (USA): genera","content":"OpenAI (USA) and Anthropic (USA): generating AI responses","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2233.93},{"type":"text","id":"tp6","name":"Other specialized AI service providers (","content":"Other specialized AI service providers (USA): AI analysis of submitted photos","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2267.57},{"type":"text","id":"tp7","name":"PostHog (EU-hosted): product analytics","content":"PostHog (EU-hosted): product analytics","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2301.21},{"type":"text","id":"tp8","name":"TelemetryDeck (Germany): anonymized prod","content":"TelemetryDeck (Germany): anonymized product analytics","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2334.85},{"type":"text","id":"tp9","name":"Amplitude (USA): product analytics","content":"Amplitude (USA): product analytics","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2368.49},{"type":"text","id":"tpa","name":"Sentry (USA): crash and error reporting","content":"Sentry (USA): crash and error reporting","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2402.13},{"type":"text","id":"tpb","name":"Google AdMob (USA): advertising in free ","content":"Google AdMob (USA): advertising in free ad-supported tiers","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2435.77},{"type":"text","id":"tpc","name":"AppsFlyer (USA/EU) and Adjust (Germany):","content":"AppsFlyer (USA/EU) and Adjust (Germany): install attribution","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2469.41},{"type":"text","id":"tpd","name":"Algolia (USA): search features","content":"Algolia (USA): search features","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":2503.05},{"type":"text","id":"tpe","name":"Legal bases","content":"Legal bases","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":80,"y":2566.65},{"type":"text","id":"tpf","name":"Under the GDPR (and the corresponding ba","content":"Under the GDPR (and the corresponding bases of the Brazilian LGPD) we process data","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":2604.05},{"type":"text","id":"tpg","name":"based on:","content":"based on:","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":2632.1},{"type":"text","id":"tph","name":"performance of a contract","content":"performance of a contract","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":159.14,"y":2632.1},{"type":"text","id":"tpi","name":"(providing the app features you use and ","content":"(providing the app features you use and your","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":376.27,"y":2632.1},{"type":"text","id":"tpj","name":"subscription),","content":"subscription),","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":2660.15},{"type":"text","id":"tpk","name":"legitimate interest","content":"legitimate interest","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":188.91,"y":2660.15},{"type":"text","id":"tpl","name":"(product analytics, crash reporting, abu","content":"(product analytics, crash reporting, abuse prevention,","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":342.19,"y":2660.15},{"type":"text","id":"tpm","name":"non-personalized ads),","content":"non-personalized ads),","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":2688.19},{"type":"text","id":"tpn","name":"consent","content":"consent","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":260.02,"y":2688.19},{"type":"text","id":"tpo","name":"(location access, personalized advertisi","content":"(location access, personalized advertising, tracking-based","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":330.06,"y":2688.19},{"type":"text","id":"tpp","name":"attribution), and","content":"attribution), and","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":131.06,"y":2716.24},{"type":"text","id":"tpq","name":"legal obligation","content":"legal obligation","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":257.25,"y":2716.24},{"type":"text","id":"tpr","name":"where applicable.","content":"where applicable.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":385.92,"y":2716.24},{"type":"text","id":"tps","name":"International transfers","content":"International transfers","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":80,"y":2779.83},{"type":"text","id":"tpt","name":"Where providers are located in the USA o","content":"Where providers are located in the USA or other countries outside the EU, transfers rely on the EU-US Data Privacy Framework, Standard Contractual Clauses, or equivalent safeguards (including those recognized by the LGPD for users in Brazil).","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":2817.24},{"type":"text","id":"tpu","name":"How long data is kept","content":"How long data is kept","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":80,"y":2936.93},{"type":"text","id":"tpv","name":"Personal data is processed and stored on","content":"Personal data is processed and stored only as long as required by the purpose it was collected for: content submitted to AI features is not retained on our servers at all; rate-limit and usage counters expire automatically within days; analytics, attribution, and crash data follow the retention settings of the respective tool. Once the retention period expires, data is deleted.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":2974.33},{"type":"text","id":"tpw","name":"Your rights","content":"Your rights","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":80,"y":3150.11},{"type":"text","id":"tpx","name":"Depending on where you live, you have th","content":"Depending on where you live, you have the right to access, rectify, delete, restrict, or receive a copy of your data, to object to processing based on legitimate interest, and to withdraw consent at any time (for tracking and location, directly in iOS Settings).","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":3187.52},{"type":"text","id":"tpy","name":"EU/EEA and Switzerland:","content":"EU/EEA and Switzerland:","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3289.26},{"type":"text","id":"tpz","name":"the rights above under the GDPR and Swis","content":"the rights above under the GDPR and Swiss FADP, and the","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":304.83,"y":3289.26},{"type":"text","id":"tq0","name":"right to complain to the Austrian Data P","content":"right to complain to the Austrian Data Protection Authority (","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3317.3},{"type":"text","id":"tq1","name":"dsb.gv.at","content":"dsb.gv.at","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","underline":true,"x":550.17,"y":3317.3},{"type":"text","id":"tq2","name":") or your local","content":") or your local","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":619.56,"y":3317.3},{"type":"text","id":"tq3","name":"supervisory authority.","content":"supervisory authority.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3345.35},{"type":"text","id":"tq4","name":"Brazil:","content":"Brazil:","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3378.99},{"type":"text","id":"tq5","name":"the rights of the LGPD, including confir","content":"the rights of the LGPD, including confirmation of processing, anonymization or","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":155.81,"y":3378.99},{"type":"text","id":"tq6","name":"elimination of unnecessary data, informa","content":"elimination of unnecessary data, information about sharing, review of automated","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3407.04},{"type":"text","id":"tq7","name":"decisions, and the right to complain to ","content":"decisions, and the right to complain to the ANPD.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3435.08},{"type":"text","id":"tq8","name":"United States:","content":"United States:","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-700","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3468.73},{"type":"text","id":"tq9","name":"where state privacy laws apply, the righ","content":"where state privacy laws apply, the right to know, correct, delete, and","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":220.64,"y":3468.73},{"type":"text","id":"tqa","name":"port your data, to opt out of the sale o","content":"port your data, to opt out of the sale or sharing of personal information and of","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3496.77},{"type":"text","id":"tqb","name":"targeted advertising, and to non-discrim","content":"targeted advertising, and to non-discrimination for exercising these rights. The","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3524.82},{"type":"text","id":"tqc","name":"tracking consent in iOS Settings is the ","content":"tracking consent in iOS Settings is the most direct opt-out for ad-related sharing.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":100,"y":3552.87},{"type":"text","id":"tqd","name":"Because we hold no account for you, exer","content":"Because we hold no account for you, exercising these rights works by email: write","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":3598.51},{"type":"text","id":"tqe","name":"to","content":"to","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":3626.55},{"type":"text","id":"tqf","name":"contact@rubenspessoa.dev","content":"contact@rubenspessoa.dev","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","underline":true,"x":99.59,"y":3626.55},{"type":"text","id":"tqg","name":".","content":".","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":310.92,"y":3626.55},{"type":"text","id":"tqh","name":"Children","content":"Children","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":80,"y":3690.15},{"type":"text","id":"tqi","name":"Our apps are not directed at children un","content":"Our apps are not directed at children under 14 (or under 13 in the United States), and we do not knowingly collect data from them. If you believe a child has provided us data, contact us and we will delete it.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":3727.55},{"type":"text","id":"tqj","name":"Changes","content":"Changes","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":80,"y":3847.24},{"type":"text","id":"tqk","name":"If we change this policy, we will update","content":"If we change this policy, we will update it here with a new effective date and, as far as technically and legally feasible, notify you in the affected app. Where changes affect processing based on your consent, we will collect new consent where required.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":3884.65}]},{"type":"ref","id":"rs2","ref":"f32","name":"footer / desktop","x":304,"y":4159.38}]}]}],"x":16740,"y":0},{"type":"ref","id":"D1z0","ref":"Ps0","name":"GH-29/A/privacy/desktop/dark","x":18260,"y":0,"theme":{"mode":"dark"}},{"type":"frame","id":"Pwk","name":"GH-29/A/privacy/mobile/light","reusable":true,"theme":{"mode":"light"},"width":390,"height":6397,"clip":true,"layout":"none","fill":"$bg","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fwj","name":"body","x":0,"y":0,"width":390,"height":6397.11,"fill":["$bg",{"type":"gradient","gradientType":"radial","colors":[{"color":"$literal-0EB8B812","position":0},{"color":"$literal-00000000","position":0.62}]}],"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fwi","name":"div.page-shell","x":0,"y":0,"width":390,"height":6397.11,"layout":"vertical","padding":[0,0,0,"$spacing-20"],"children":[{"type":"ref","id":"rwl","ref":"f3h","name":"header / mobile","x":20,"y":0},{"type":"frame","id":"fv5","name":"main","x":20,"y":95.67,"width":350,"height":5982.13,"layout":"none","children":[{"type":"text","id":"tsd","name":"LEGAL","content":"LEGAL","fill":"$ink-muted","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-12_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-590","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing-1_28","x":12.78,"y":55.94},{"type":"text","id":"tse","name":"Privacy Policy","content":"Privacy Policy","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-30","fontSize":"$fontSize-30_4","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_67","x":0,"y":88.37},{"type":"text","id":"tsf","name":"Effective date: July 23, 2026","content":"Effective date: July 23, 2026","fill":"$ink-muted","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-15_2","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":137.05},{"type":"text","id":"tsg","name":"This policy covers all apps published by","content":"This policy covers all apps published by Rubens Pessoa de Barros Filho, BSc, operating under the business name “Pixeldog” (“we”), their websites, and this website. It explains what data is processed, why, who processes it, and the rights you have. It is written to apply to every app we publish, so depending on which app you use, only a subset of it applies.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":194.65},{"type":"text","id":"tsh","name":"The short version: our apps are designed","content":"The short version: our apps are designed to work without accounts, your content stays on your device (and in your own iCloud, if you use it), payments run through Apple, and we do not sell your personal data.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":464.66},{"type":"text","id":"tsi","name":"Who is responsible","content":"Who is responsible","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":0,"y":640.44},{"type":"text","id":"tsj","name":"Rubens Pessoa de Barros Filho,","content":"Rubens Pessoa de Barros Filho,","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":677.85},{"type":"text","id":"tsk","name":"BSc (Pixeldog)","content":"BSc (Pixeldog)","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":705.9},{"type":"text","id":"tsl","name":"UNESCO-Esplanade 8/55, 8020 Graz, Austri","content":"UNESCO-Esplanade 8/55, 8020 Graz, Austria","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":733.94},{"type":"text","id":"tsm","name":"Email:","content":"Email:","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":761.99},{"type":"text","id":"tsn","name":"contact@rubenspessoa.dev","content":"contact@rubenspessoa.dev","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","underline":true,"x":49.61,"y":761.99},{"type":"text","id":"tso","name":"See the","content":"See the","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":807.63},{"type":"text","id":"tsp","name":"imprint","content":"imprint","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","underline":true,"x":62.27,"y":807.63},{"type":"text","id":"tsq","name":"for full legal details.","content":"for full legal details.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":119.73,"y":807.63},{"type":"text","id":"tsr","name":"What we process","content":"What we process","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":0,"y":871.22},{"type":"text","id":"tss","name":"What is processed depends on the feature","content":"What is processed depends on the features of the app you use. Across our apps, processing falls into these categories:","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":908.63},{"type":"text","id":"tst","name":"AI features","content":"AI features","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":0,"y":1020.72},{"type":"text","id":"tsu","name":"In apps with AI features, the content yo","content":"In apps with AI features, the content you submit for processing — photos, text, uploaded documents, or text transcribed from voice input — is sent through our servers to third-party AI providers, solely to generate the result. This content carries no account identifier, is not used to train AI models under our API agreements, and is not stored on our servers: it is processed in memory and discarded.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":1048.93},{"type":"text","id":"tsv","name":"Your content","content":"Your content","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":0,"y":1357.34},{"type":"text","id":"tsw","name":"The content you create in our apps — sav","content":"The content you create in our apps — saved photos, chat history, habits, notes, and similar — is stored on your device and, if you use iCloud, synced through your own private iCloud storage. We run no accounts and keep no copy on our servers.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":1385.55},{"type":"text","id":"tsx","name":"Anonymous identifiers","content":"Anonymous identifiers","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":0,"y":1581.78},{"type":"text","id":"tsy","name":"Apps that talk to our servers create an ","content":"Apps that talk to our servers create an anonymous identifier via Firebase to enforce fair usage limits and connect a subscription to your installation, and may verify requests with Firebase App Check to keep bots away. We cannot identify you personally from these identifiers.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":1609.99},{"type":"text","id":"tsz","name":"Location","content":"Location","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":0,"y":1834.26},{"type":"text","id":"tt0","name":"In apps with location-based features, an","content":"In apps with location-based features, and only with your permission, your device location is used at query time to show nearby results. It is not stored as a movement history.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":1862.48},{"type":"text","id":"tt1","name":"Ads and attribution","content":"Ads and attribution","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":0,"y":2002.61},{"type":"text","id":"tt2","name":"In apps with a free ad-supported tier, a","content":"In apps with a free ad-supported tier, ads are served by Google AdMob: if you allow tracking in the iOS App Tracking Transparency prompt, ads may be personalized; if you decline, they are not. Attribution services (such as AppsFlyer or Adjust) process device identifiers to attribute app installs to marketing campaigns, subject to the same tracking choice.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":2030.82},{"type":"text","id":"tt3","name":"Analytics and crash reporting","content":"Analytics and crash reporting","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":0,"y":2311.19},{"type":"text","id":"tt4","name":"Our apps may collect analytics events ab","content":"Our apps may collect analytics events about feature usage — not the content you create — and crash reports (device model, OS version, crash traces) to keep the apps working well.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":2339.4},{"type":"text","id":"tt5","name":"This website and app websites","content":"This website and app websites","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-16_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_25","x":0,"y":2479.53},{"type":"text","id":"tt6","name":"This website (rubenspessoa.dev) is stati","content":"This website (rubenspessoa.dev) is static and sets no cookies and runs no analytics. Some app websites use analytics and, where required, ask for cookie consent; their processing is covered by the services listed below.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":2507.74},{"type":"text","id":"tt7","name":"Third-party services","content":"Third-party services","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":0,"y":2711.57},{"type":"text","id":"tt8","name":"We keep the list of processors as small ","content":"We keep the list of processors as small as each app allows. Not every service is used by every app — which subset applies depends on the app’s features. Contact us for app-specific details:","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":350.5,"x":0,"y":2748.98},{"type":"text","id":"tt9","name":"Apple (USA): App Sto