 and we do not warrant their accuracy. Liability for damage to life, body, or health, and your mandatory statutory rights as a consumer, remain unaffected.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":672.5,"x":80,"y":2330.62},{"type":"text","id":"t12o","name":"Governing law","content":"Governing law","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":80,"y":2534.44},{"type":"text","id":"t12p","name":"These terms are governed by Austrian law","content":"These terms are governed by Austrian law, excluding its conflict-of-law rules and the UN","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":2571.85},{"type":"text","id":"t12q","name":"Convention on Contracts for the Internat","content":"Convention on Contracts for the International Sale of Goods. If you are a consumer —","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":2599.9},{"type":"text","id":"t12r","name":"wherever you live — the mandatory consum","content":"wherever you live — the mandatory consumer-protection provisions of your country of","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":2627.94},{"type":"text","id":"t12s","name":"residence remain applicable. The Europea","content":"residence remain applicable. The European Commission provides an","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":80,"y":2655.99},{"type":"text","id":"t12t","name":"online dispute resolutio