ple via the App Store. Manage or cancel subscriptions in your Apple account’s subscription settings. Prices shown on our websites are informational; the price presented by Apple at purchase applies. Free-tier usage limits (and, in apps with a free ad-supported tier, ads) are part of the Services and may be adjusted over time. In apps offering AI features, the set of available AI models may change as providers change their offerings.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":280.5,"x":0,"y":2447.26},{"type":"text","id":"t19q","name":"Your content","content":"Your content","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":0,"y":2903.5},{"type":"text","id":"t19r","name":"You keep all rights to the content","content":"You keep all rights to the content","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":2940.91},{"type":"text","id":"t19s","name":"you submit — photos, messages,","content":"you submit — photos, messages,","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":2968.96},{"type":"text","id":"t19t","name":"documents, habits, and notes. You","content":"documents, habits, and notes. You","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":2997.01},{"type":"text","id":"t19u","name":"grant us the limited right to process","content":"grant us the limited right to process","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":3025.0