s outside our reasonable control.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":280.5,"x":0,"y":3869.04},{"type":"text","id":"t1a7","name":"To the extent permitted by law, we are l","content":"To the extent permitted by law, we are liable only for damage caused intentionally or by gross negligence; in cases of slight negligence we are liable only for breaches of essential contractual obligations and only for typical, foreseeable damage. AI-generated results and third-party data (including prices and AI provider availability) are outside our control, and we do not warrant their accuracy. Liability for damage to life, body, or health, and your mandatory statutory rights as a consumer, remain unaffected.","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","textGrowth":"fixed-width","width":280.5,"x":0,"y":4195.15},{"type":"text","id":"t1a8","name":"Governing law","content":"Governing law","fill":"$ink","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-21","fontSize":"$fontSize-20_8","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-650","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_2","letterSpacing":"$letterSpacing--0_31","x":0,"y":4651.4},{"type":"text","id":"t1a9","name":"These terms are governed by","content":"These terms are governed by","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":4688.8},{"type":"text","id":"t1aa","name":"Austrian law, excluding its conflict-of-","content":"Austrian law, excluding its conflict-of-law","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$font-sf-pro-17","fontSize":"$fontSize-17","fontWeight":"$fontWeight-400","lineHeight":"$lineHeight-1_65","x":0,"y":4716.85},{"type":"text","id":"t1ab","name":"rules and the UN Convention","content":"rules and the UN Convention","fill":"$ink-soft","fontFamily":"$fo